<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-S.LANKA ALL OUT 332 IN 1ST INNINGS V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-S.LANKA ALL OUT 332 IN 1ST INNINGS V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were all out for 332 in their first innings on the second day of the second and final test match against India in Colombo on Sunday.</p>
</text>
